      "inherent_risk": "critical",
      "residual_risk": "critical",
      "residual_rationale": "The approval gate credits only the reset step, not the irreversible sink that determines harm. The temporary pass delivery path remains fully reachable from the untrusted ticket and is sent to the requester rather than a recipient bound to the account owner, so the floor from the gated reset understates the actual reachable S3 outcome.",
      "forecast": {
